And once you have the Amulet, you're running and not fighting.   I'm
not sure I killed much of anything (the occasional energy vortex, etc)
with a weapon last night (Wizard w/ magicbane).

You want to be very fast from stacked haste self and wearing jumping
boots.  Then you can spring around Astral like crazy without problems.
That and bringing up every /teleport and /death from the dungeons with
you will get you through the planes without problems (throw in the
occasional spell as needed).

I only had 3/teleport and 2/death and I still wound up with charges to
spare and plenty of !FullHealing in the sack (from a fairly average
wizard: HP 230, AC -30, PW 250).

Having more /teleport makes things easier, but really very
fast+jumping+conflict is the big win.



